{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01419",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 4.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.96,
      "end_seconds": 9.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.15,
      "end_seconds": 13.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Well, I've been having watery diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.3,
      "end_seconds": 18.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.66,
      "end_seconds": 22.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Since Monday, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.62,
      "end_seconds": 29.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.29,
      "end_seconds": 37.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "It settles a little with oral rehydration. It happens every other day. Moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.77,
      "end_seconds": 41.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Okay, does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.5,
      "end_seconds": 54.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.15,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get crampy tummy pain as well. The crampy tummy pain? That's been for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.46,
      "end_seconds": 59.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.13,
      "end_seconds": 76.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.21,
      "end_seconds": 101.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 38.0 degrees, BP is 124 over 78, pulse 100."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.0,
      "end_seconds": 106.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.9,
      "end_seconds": 112.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.16,
      "end_seconds": 119.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.88,
      "end_seconds": 128.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.34,
      "end_seconds": 131.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.24,
      "end_seconds": 151.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild general tenderness and your mouth is a little dry."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.84,
      "end_seconds": 157.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.41,
      "end_seconds": 173.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Did you notice any blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.91,
      "end_seconds": 180.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Not at all, um, no blood in the stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.69,
      "end_seconds": 185.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "And what about severe dehydration or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.66,
      "end_seconds": 190.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "I haven't had severe dehydration or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.0,
      "end_seconds": 195.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.51,
      "end_seconds": 198.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.76,
      "end_seconds": 200.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.35,
      "end_seconds": 204.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.02,
      "end_seconds": 207.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.69,
      "end_seconds": 210.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.75,
      "end_seconds": 215.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Right, do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.87,
      "end_seconds": 220.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.03,
      "end_seconds": 224.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.62,
      "end_seconds": 231.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.07,
      "end_seconds": 250.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.6,
      "end_seconds": 252.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.69,
      "end_seconds": 258.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Okay, are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.4,
      "end_seconds": 262.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.64,
      "end_seconds": 266.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.0,
      "end_seconds": 274.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to amoxicillin, but I don't remember what reaction I had."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.63,
      "end_seconds": 279.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.67,
      "end_seconds": 287.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.26,
      "end_seconds": 313.52,
      "duration_seconds": 14.26,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, the most likely explanation is travellers' diarrhoea. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had watery diarrhoea, since Monday, moderate, and no vomiting or blood in the stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.8,
      "end_seconds": 317.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Mm, uh, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.64,
      "end_seconds": 323.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Let's book a stool sample to look into diarrhoea after travel."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.13,
      "end_seconds": 327.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.07,
      "end_seconds": 335.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Drink plenty of fluids and wash your hands carefully. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.11,
      "end_seconds": 339.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.02,
      "end_seconds": 344.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}